## Architecture Decision & ASR Alignment (Milestone 2 Baseline)

The system is organized into a **Proportional N-Tier Layered Monolith** enforcing the Dependency Inversion Principle across three decoupled assemblies: Presentation Layer (`CivicConnect.Web` / `CivicConnect.Api`), Core Domain Layer (`CivicConnect.Core`), and Infrastructure Layer (`CivicConnect.Infrastructure`).

* **ASR 1: Operational Budget & Team Size Constraint:** Aligns with R0 budget and reduced team split by selecting an N-Tier monolith over complex microservices, requiring only a single deployment instance.
* **ASR 2: Query Performance & Latency (NFR-001):** Uses high-performance compiled C# .NET runtime and explicit database indexing on `Status`, `CategoryID`, `CreatedByUserID`, and `TrackingID` to prevent full table scans.
* **ASR 3: Multi-Tenant Role Security (NFR-002):** Enforces centralized authorization middleware in the Presentation layer validating claims on every request.

